<title>UK: BNG sets 300 million mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>BNG sets 300 million mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>joint lead managers ING Barings and Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.625     MATURITY    06.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.31    PAY DATE    06.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.56     SPREAD	+19 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/AMST  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OBL SERIES 121</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
